Lanarkstone's Westie Treasures
Overview
Lanarkstone's Westie Treasures is a web-based e-commerce and digital preservation platform for West Highland White Terrier collectibles.

The project supports:

Online product catalog
Inventory management
Customer purchasing
Historical collection preservation
Business reporting and analytics
Courses
AD371 Application Architecture
AD450 Data Science Development
Project Manager
David Davis

Current Phase
Project Planning and Requirements Analysis